#: includes/Admin/Verificationpage.php:1667
msgid "A valid PDF has exactly <strong>one</strong> %s marker. Each extra marker signals that content was <strong>appended after the original cross-reference table</strong> was written. This is the standard technique for a <strong>PDF shadow attack / incremental update</strong>: an attacker appends new objects that override visible content while leaving the original seal intact."
